  "title": "Enovis™ Companion Animal Health Launches CT-RevitL™, the Next-Generation Laser Therapy System for Veterinary Care",
  "summary": "DALLAS, TX, July 13, 2026 - Enovis™ Corporation (NYSE: ENOV), an innovation-driven medical technology company, today announced the U.S. launch of CT-RevitL™, the next-generation veterinary PBM laser therapy system from its Companion Animal Health business. CT-RevitL delivers enhanced clinical performance, greater mobility and a more intuitive treatment experience for veterinary teams and their patients.",
